<title>USA: Strayer Education Q1 proforma net increases.</title>
<headline>Strayer Education Q1 proforma net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						    1997		 1996</p>
<p> Total Revenues				13,773	    12,001</p>
<p> Net income				     4,182	     4,736</p>
<p>Pro forma Information (for 1996):</p>
<p> Income taxes					--	     1,852</p>
<p>   Net income				   4,182	     2,884</p>
<p> Net income per share (1996 pro forma)   0.43		0.39</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p> (1996 pro forma)			     9,836	     7,401</p>
<p>		 (Amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Strayer Education Inc it reported the pro forma adjustment to reflect the effect of corporate income taxes as though the company were a C Corporation in 1996.</p>
